</tbody>
</table>
</figure>
<div id="A5.SS4.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.SS4.p3.1" class="ltx_p">We next report the results on the MMLU dataset in <a href="#A5.T5" title="In E.4 Omitted Details in ‣ Appendix E Omitted Details in ‣ Beyond Majority Voting: LLM Aggregation by Leveraging Higher-Order Information" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Table</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a>. On this dataset, we find that OW-L, OW-I, and ISP outperform MV across all ensembles.</p>
</div>
